    "title": "DIY Emoji: Funny Emoji Maker",
    "description": "DIY Emoji: Funny Emoji Maker is the perfect creative app for people who love emojis and want to design their own unique \r\nemojis. The application provides two main functions: creating emojis (Emoji Maker) and combining emojis (Emoji Mixer), bringing \r\ndiversity and fun to your creative experience.\r\n\r\nMain function:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd20Create Emoji:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fDIY Rich Accessory: Providing 500+  accessories such as eyes, mouths, hats, glasses and many different facial expressions, \r\nhelping you unleash your creativity in your own style.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fFlip: Easily flip elements on your emoji horizontally or vertically to create unique effects.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fDraw: Add details by drawing to your liking. Drawing tools let you add personalized accents and decorations.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fAdd Text: Insert text into emojis with diverse font and color options to add a unique text or name.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fLayer: Easily change the layer order of emoji elements to create the desired visual effect. You can put one detail above or \r\nbelow other details to create a perfect composition.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd74Emoji Mixer:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fUnique combination: Allows you to choose any two emojis in the emoji set and mixer them to create a new and unique emoji. This\r\nfeature that helps you experiment and explore different combinations.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fUnlimited Creativity: With the emoji matching feature, the only limit is your imagination. Combine fun, cute, or even quirky emojis to \r\ncreate fun emoticons.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fEasy Sharing: Save your paired emojis and share them with friends via social networks or messaging apps easily.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08Diverse Emoji Library:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fStorage and Management: Create and store all your personalized emojis in one convenient library, making it easy to manage and reuse \r\nwhen needed.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fQuick search: Use search tools to quickly find sticker and emoji themes already available in the app.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf35Updated frequently:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fConstant New Content: The app regularly updates with new accessories and emotes, ensuring you always have new options to \r\nexplore and create.\r\n\r\nDIY Emoji: Funny Emoji Maker is a great application for those who want to express their personality and creativity through emoticons. \r\nYou can easily create unique and unique emojis, helping to enrich Add your chat. \r\n\ud83d\udd25Download DIY Emoji: Funny Emoji Maker today to start your own fun and inspiring emoji creation journey!\ud83d\udd25",
